ArcRouter Style Collection 2.2

The MIT license applies to the ArcRouter-authored SKILL.md, preset labels and
visual descriptions, gallery code and ArcRouter-generated demonstration sheets. It does not relicense external work.

Collection idea reference: yang0/handraw-style
https://github.com/yang0/handraw-style
The reviewed upstream repository did not declare a license. Its original
instructions, artist index, numbered mapping, scripts and images are not included.
Demonstration sheets were generated with the built-in image-generation tool.
They are illustrative samples, not guaranteed results. This repository includes the generated preview assets for local gallery viewing.
The 96 presets use ArcRouter IDs and medium-based descriptions. They do not
promise an exact match to any upstream reference image. MAPLE01 is a separate
featured avatar preset. MapleStory is referenced only as a style description;
this package is not affiliated with its publisher and includes no official game assets.
